From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer: libmediametrics visible to vendor/apklayer

The audioserver shared entrypoint in vendor/apklayer reuses the original metrics library; Soong permits
only the vendor subtree as a visibility grant from outside vendor. Formerly part of scripts/patch-audio.sh.
Against frameworks/av 937eb9047ec2 (REVISION). Apply: patches/apply aosp <LineageOS tree>.
---
diff --git a/media/libmediametrics/Android.bp b/media/libmediametrics/Android.bp
index 37a71dd6b4..30bbef9203 100644
--- a/media/libmediametrics/Android.bp
+++ b/media/libmediametrics/Android.bp
@@ -75,6 +75,8 @@ cc_library {
     },
 
     visibility: [
+        // apklayer patch: the audioserver shared entrypoint reuses original metrics.
+        "//vendor:__subpackages__",
         "//cts/tests/tests/nativemedia/mediametrics",
         "//frameworks/av:__subpackages__",
         "//frameworks/base/apex/media/framework",
